<title>BANGLADESH: Port conditions - Bangladesh  - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions - Bangladesh  - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>Labour disputes - Bangladesh</p>
<p>CHITTAGONG, April 8 - Work suspended at port with effect from 0100 local time due to truck drivers/helpers strike after an accident where in which one of the workers died. Meetings are being held with all concerned to resolve. Loading/ unloading/delivery of cargo at all jetties, except mooring berth, has stopped.</p>
</text>
